-- Queer Atlas venue intelligence: global review-led editorial pass, batch 37.
-- Eight Berlin records, individually researched and rewritten.
-- SchwuZ is now a nomadic event series; Tabasco closed permanently on 2026-03-15.
-- Tiergarten is an unstaffed public cruising area, so safety and consent replace a conventional service score.
-- Checked 2026-08-06. Source names remain in evidence metadata, not reader-facing topic copy.

